  "summary": "对固定整数数组多次查询闭区间 left 到 right 的元素和。",
  "insight": "构造时保存前缀和 prefix[i+1]，任意区间和可由两个前缀相减常数时间得到。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "前缀数组比原数组多一个零位",
    "闭区间右端对应 prefix[right+1]",
    "同一对象会执行多次查询"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "prefix-sums",
      "title": "一维前缀和",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "预处理从开头到每个位置之前的总和。",
      "steps": [
        "prefix[0]=0",
        "prefix[i+1]=prefix[i]+nums[i]",
        "sumRange=prefix[right+1]-prefix[left]"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "build O(n), query O(1)",
        "space": "O(n)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/prefix-sums/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/prefix-sums/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/prefix-sums/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
